Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,H_ms,,0,0,0,,Kenapa awak kisah dia hidup atau mati?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Dia cuma Jian Tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Shen Xiujin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.82,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Jangan berdalih.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:04.12,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau dia bukan kekasih awak,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:05.06,S_ms,,0,0,0,,kenapa awak kisah dia hidup atau mati?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:06.46,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Dia demam, apa kaitan dengan awak?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:07.78,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Jangan kata awak kesian padanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:09.70,S_ms,,0,0,0,,CEO Shen yang hebat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.30,S_ms,,0,0,0,,sejak bila jadi bertimbang rasa sangat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.66,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau dia bukan kekasih awak,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.94,S_ms,,0,0,0,,maukah awak sendiri memandu tengah malam
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:14.88,S_ms,,0,0,0,,ke hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:16.70,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Biar betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.56,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Encik Shen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:20.92,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau tak ada hal lain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:21.86,S_ms,,0,0,0,,saya keluar dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:22.88,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya tinggalkan dia di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.74,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Jaga dia baik-baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:26.74,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau dia sedar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:27.76,S_ms,,0,0,0,,beritahu dia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:29.08,S_ms,,0,0,0,,ketika dia pengsan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:30.80,S_ms,,0,0,0,,awak panggil kenalan untuk merawat dia.
